  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0: New sector-size-aware generic formats - GenericIsoRaw split into GenericIsoRaw2352 / GenericIsoRaw2048; GenericCueIso, GenericCueBinWav and GenericCueIsoWav split into 2352/2048 variants; GenericCueBin2352Default renamed GenericCueBin2352. Added ConsoleTypeRegistry (display names + CLI aliases) and made ParserFactory.GetAllSupportedConsoles() registry-driven. Fixed virtual CUE export for 2048-cooked variants - audio tracks in BIN files now always use 2352-byte sectors and CUE track modes reflect the actual sector size. Code modernization (consistent var usage). New multi-page wiki documentation (docs/) and WhatsNew.md shipped in the package. BREAKING: removed GenericIsoRaw, GenericCueIso, GenericCueBinWav, GenericCueIsoWav and GenericCueBin2352Default.",
